-- 3. Expansion — full synth palette (still no drums)

setbpm 125

d1 $ subDrone

xfadeIn 2 8 $ lowPad

xfadeIn 3 8 $ highPad

xfadeIn 4 8 $ arp

xfadeIn 8 8 $ bassPulse

xfadeIn 5 16 $ lead

xfadeIn 6 16 $ bell # gain 0.7

xfadeIn 7 16 $ noiseBed

xfadeIn 9 16 $ shimmer # gain 0.6

-- longer melody option instead of the lead
-- xfadeIn 5 16 $ melody

-- open the arp filter on the next pass
-- xfadeIn 4 16 $ arp # lpf (range 1800 4200 $ slow 8 sine)
